/// M08 CORE-011 "cookies session: roots green, eighteen assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/cookies_csrf_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledCookiesCSRF (L17-195).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/cookies/session.can (read at
/// L46, staged as src/main.can at L50); every count pin below grounds an
/// assert arm in that fixture (find_cookie 3, session_id 2, bake 2,
/// forget 2, mint 1, roundtrip 1, guarded 1, login 2, establish 1,
/// table 1, boot 1, main 1; total 18).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 18 roots, grounded per function in the session.can fixture,
/// with supplied-completion and real-can evidence present.
/// The live lifecycle, generated functions and build identity live in
/// core-011-cookies-semantics.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-011-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); lifecycle variants
/// (establish, bare token, theme/session match, wrong session, bogus
/// token, stop/wait) live in the cookies-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_TSC gates the optional strict
/// tsc leg (pinned conditional in the run-shape file). Logical gates
/// SUITE/WORK/PROC and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run
/// now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L24).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case cookies/session-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, supplied-evidence, real-evidence,
/// find-roots, session-roots, bake-roots, forget-roots, mint-roots,
/// roundtrip-roots, guarded-roots, login-roots, establish-roots,
/// table-roots, boot-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (cookies_csrf_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert
/// leg (L70-73: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L75: passed true); root-count pins
/// the eighteen roots (L75: len assertions is 18); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the staged fixture (L46: session.can; L50: src/main.can);
/// supplied-evidence pins supplied completion evidence (L78:
/// supplied-completion; fixture L70-73: mint stands in via when-sample);
/// real-evidence pins real native evidence (L78: real-can; fixture L87
/// and L100: roundtrip/guarded run the real csrf::verify); find-roots
/// pins find_cookie (fixture L11-13: hit/miss/empty, 3 roots);
/// session-roots pins session_id (fixture L27-28: present/absent, 2);
/// bake-roots pins bake (fixture L41-42: sample/evil, 2); forget-roots
/// pins forget (fixture L54-55: sample/evil, 2); mint-roots pins mint
/// (fixture L69: sample, 1); roundtrip-roots pins roundtrip (fixture
/// L84: sample, 1); guarded-roots pins guarded (fixture L99: bogus, 1);
/// login-roots pins login (fixture L112-113: no_session/bogus, 2);
/// establish-roots pins establish (fixture L141: sample, 1);
/// table-roots pins table (fixture L151: sample, 1); boot-roots pins
/// boot (fixture L165: sample, 1); main-roots pins main (fixture L182:
/// sample, 1).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
